; Checks an edge case when the component count is an OpSpecConstantOp with
; udiv by 0. This is illegal arithmetic and LLVM can't fold it into a ConstantInt,
; in this case the Reader must check and reject.

; RUN: not llvm-spirv -spirv-text -r %s -o %t.bc 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

; CHECK: InvalidInstruction
; CHECK: TypeVectorIdEXT: component count must evaluate to a constant integer

119734787 66304 458752 11 0
2 Capability Addresses
2 Capability Linkage
2 Capability Kernel
2 Capability LongVectorEXT
6 Extension "SPV_EXT_long_vector"
3 MemoryModel 2 2
3 Source 3 102000
4 Name 1 "test"

6 Decorate 1 LinkageAttributes "test" Export
4 TypeInt 3 32 0
4 Constant 3 5 0
6 SpecConstantOp 3 6 134 5 5
2 TypeVoid 2
3 TypeFloat 4 32
4 TypeVectorIdEXT 7 4 6
4 TypeFunction 8 2 7

5 Function 2 1 0 8
3 FunctionParameter 7 9

2 Label 10
1 Return

1 FunctionEnd
